      "statusChangeNewStatus": "closed",
      "value": "This doesn't appear to be a bug report, and is instead what we'd consider a support request.\nIt's almost certainly your own connection at home! Barring horrible routing issues or something similar, our services are working fine and certainly aren't having 2-3 second delays to all users.\nYou may want to consider using a direct ethernet connection if you're using PC.\n---\nPlease contact our [Support team](http://help.vrchat.com/hc/en-us/requests/new) and report your issue there. Please include as much information as possible, such as game logs, screenshots, and etc. Video is also very helpful, if applicable.\nIn the mean-time, you can try checking out http://help.vrchat.com and see if any of the solutions listed there help you out.\nOur support team will get back to you as soon as possible.",
